<title>USA: Time Warner and News Corp settle, Time to carry Fox.</title>
<headline>Time Warner and News Corp settle, Time to carry Fox.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Time Warner Inc will put News Corp's Fox News channel on Time's cable TV system, the two companies said Wednesday, saying they had agreed to settle the dispute between them.</p>
<p>As part of the settlement all outstanding litigation between Time and News Corp will be discontinued as well as all litigation between Time Warner and New York City.</p>
</text>
